{"title":"Elder Bog","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 35 Bog that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Sunken Trove</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 32</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-2000\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"elder-bog\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bog: <a href=\"#/monster/bogling\">Bogling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/bog\">Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/mire-bog\">Mire Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(37)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ancient-bog\">Ancient Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/1fc398c9d042e4ee3267.webp\" alt=\"Elder Bog\"></div><h3>Elder Bog</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>35 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–35)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bog</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>152</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>23.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1750</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>23 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}